## 13. 动画
```css
/* 卡片入场 — 从下淡入 */
@keyframes card-enter {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
.card-enter { animation: card-enter 0.3s var(--ease-apple) backwards; }
/* stagger: 每张卡片延迟 50ms */
.card-enter:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0ms; }
.card-enter:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 50ms; }
.card-enter:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 100ms; }

/* 面板滑出 — 从右滑入 */
@keyframes slide-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(24px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
}
.panel-enter { animation: slide-in 0.3s var(--ease-apple); }

/* 对话气泡 — 缩放弹出 */
@keyframes bubble-pop {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
}
.bubble-enter { animation: bubble-pop 0.2s var(--ease-apple); }

/* 进度条 — 流动条纹 */
@keyframes shimmer {
  0%   { background-position: -200% 0; }
  100% { background-position: 200% 0; }
}
.progress-indeterminate {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, var(--apple-blue) 50%, transparent 100%);
  background-size: 200% 100%;
  animation: shimmer 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
}
```

